<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR edges up, 3-mo, 6-mo edges down.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR edges up, 3-mo, 6-mo edges down.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) edged up for the one-month maturity and eased for the three- and six-month maturities, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on its  BUBOR Reuters page on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was set at 21.28 percent, up 0.01, the three-month rate at 21.18 percent, down 0.01 and the six-month rate at 21.03 percent, also down 0.01.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
